                            "description":  "Someone - or something - is destroying the seven most powerful robots in the world one after the other; brutally dismantling them without any provocation on their part. Gesicht, one of the seven and a detective for the European Federation — Europol, embarks on a mission to capture the killer…and confront the mysteries behind the vague but disturbing memories that keep haunting him in his dreams.  \n\nUrasawa\u0027s approach on \"The Greatest Robot on Earth\" chapter of Astro Boy done in celebration of Atom\u0027s in universe birthday (April 7th, 2003).",
